| `launcher.credentials.<name>` | object | `{}` | a launch key mapped to `model_adapter` (null or a name `models.available` lists) and `names` (environment variable names, each once) | `scripts/launch.py` (`load_launcher_config`) | Names the only credential variables the launched process for that launch key may receive, here or on the farm, and the model adapter whose `models.credential_env` names `build_child_env` adds; with no entry it receives none. A launch whose environment would hold any other credential name is refused with exit 2 before anything runs or is recorded. | the variables every child gets: `child_env.names` | always |
